  m_Text: "1. Start \u2192 two cubes and a prefab sphere hover (kinematic, gravity
    off) while in the background a snapshot was taken on start\n\n2. Optionally click
    on Snapshot and then on Turn On Gravity \u2192 the objects drop, physics runs\n\n3.
    Now click on Resoter Sphere Prefab or Restore Cube 1 or Restore Cube 2 \u2192
    snap just that cube back to its last saved state, without loading the whole scene,\neverything
    else stays untouched in contrast to clicking on the Load Complete Scene button"
